                "message": "✨ Add a config-files TODO agenda view (C-c o a c)\n\nLists open TODO headings of the yadm-tracked Org files (or of listed\nfolders), with the file title as the line prefix. Documented in the\nsp-org-agenda doc.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01WWLNiByGEMc2iZouwYY3kJ",
